# Context filter for packages/indexer/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Allow-list: the manifests every workspace needs, and the sources of the packages that are built.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/*/package.json
!packages/shared
!packages/parser
!packages/core
!packages/engine
!packages/views
!packages/indexer
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.git
